Epoch_multiUserDeposit
├── given the active strategy is local to Parent
├── and two depositors submit different USDC amounts in the same epoch
├── when CRE closes the epoch through WorkflowRouter
├── then ParentVault should mark the epoch claimable
├── and ParentVault should open the next epoch
├── and ParentVault should deposit the combined net USDC into the local adapter
├── and the first depositor should claim Yieldcoin shares proportional to their deposit
└── and the second depositor should claim Yieldcoin shares proportional to their deposit

Epoch_multiUserWithdraw
├── given the active strategy is local to Parent
├── and two depositors have claimed Yieldcoin shares from a prior epoch
├── and both submit share burn requests in the same epoch
├── when CRE closes the epoch through WorkflowRouter
├── then ParentVault should withdraw the combined net USDC from the local adapter
├── and ParentVault should mark the epoch claimable
├── and ParentVault should open the next epoch
├── and the first withdrawer should claim USDC proportional to their share burn
└── and the second withdrawer should claim USDC proportional to their share burn

Epoch_multiUserMixed
├── given the active strategy is local to Parent
├── and a withdrawer has claimed Yieldcoin shares from a prior epoch
├── and a depositor submits USDC in the current epoch
├── and the withdrawer submits a share burn request in the same epoch
├── when CRE closes the epoch through WorkflowRouter
├── then ParentVault should settle the net flow with the local adapter
├── and ParentVault should mark the epoch claimable
├── and ParentVault should open the next epoch
├── and the depositor should claim Yieldcoin shares
└── and the withdrawer should claim USDC while their shares are burned
